          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abarira Yehu ati: “Ko wagize neza mu gukora ibibereye mu nyonga zanje, ugashitsa ivyo nipfuza gukorera ab’inzu ya Ahabu hamwe n’ibindi vyose nipfuza gukora, uruvyaro rwawe ruzokwicara ku ntebe y’ubwami bwa Isirayeli gushika ku runganwe rugira kane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Yehu ntiyitaho gukurikiza Ivyagezwe vy’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana ya Isirayeli n’umutima wiwe wose. Ntiyava mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu, ivyo yakwegeyemwo n’Abisirayeli bakabikora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
